## Widget id: tsb.livedoc.matrix

<b>The tsb.LiveDoc.matrix widget</b> developed by Trinity Software and Beyond, provides an innovative matrix display of documents based on lucene queries performed on the workitems within each document. Every cell within the matrix represents a lucene query count, offering a clickable link leading to a detailed table view of the results of the respective query. This powerful tool is an addition to our suite of matrix widgets, allowing for a more granular and dynamic view into the distribution and categorization of workitems across documents within the Polarion ALM platform. This approach transforms data into actionable insights, promoting efficient document management and aiding strategic decision-making processes. 
